      "description": "# CC Bomber CBB-1301717\nThe CBB-1301717 Bomber/Gunship is a massive flying fortress that sources its technology and combat role from relic vessels like the B-17 and AC-130. CBB-1301717 is armed with over 16 mounted weapons, manufactured across a plethora of Continental Conglomerate member states. They include quad and dual-mounted medium machine guns, two pilot-operated chainguns, 20mm flak cannons, Heavy Machine Guns mounted on the plane\u2019s side superstructure and pair of ball turrets, a set of heavy 40mm guns, and dual frontal autocannons, all supplemented in the ground role by a total of 48 unguided high explosive bombs.\n\n# Model\nThe model itself is one of my older models (2022). I based this model on the b17-flying-fortress and ac-130 aswel as the bomber from the short video \"flying fortress\" by Dima Fedotov. The model was initialy developed for a modding project, \"Reclamation-Eden (RE)\" in a small indie game called Ravenfield.",
